OL,3,GNEWSA'Looking after my brother changed
OL,4,Achildhood for us'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeah has turned those experiences into
OL,7,Fpoetry, performing pieces about young
OL,8,Fcarers at the Cheltenham Literature
OL,9,FFestival.
OL,11,FShe says support from Gloucestershire
OL,12,FYoung Carers has helped her recognise
OL,13,Fthe value of what she does: "Sometimes
OL,14,Fwhen I'm doubting myself, that it
OL,15,Fcounts as caring and not just being an
OL,16,Folder sister," she said.
